  'Comparison mode': ['Mode de comparaison', '比较模式'],
  'Conditions for both: {stay} h stay, {margin}° Earth margin, {sun} h continuous sun from touchdown, Earth at touchdown {state}.': ['Conditions communes : séjour de {stay} h, marge Terre {margin}°, {sun} h de soleil continu depuis l\u2019atterrissage, Terre à l\u2019atterrissage {state}.', '两者条件相同：停留 {stay} 小时、地球余量 {margin}°、着陆起连续日照 {sun} 小时、着陆时地球{state}。'],
