  'no continuous {sun} h of sunlight from touchdown at {sunFails} starts; Earth below the {margin}° margin at {earthFails}; stay not covered at {covFails}.': ['pas de {sun} h de soleil continu depuis l\u2019atterrissage sur {sunFails} départs ; Terre sous la marge de {margin}° sur {earthFails} ; séjour non couvert sur {covFails}.', '在 {sunFails} 个着陆时刻无法满足着陆起连续 {sun} 小时日照；在 {earthFails} 个时刻地球低于 {margin}° 余量；在 {covFails} 个时刻停留超出数据覆盖。'],
